# OWNER REVIEW
# The prize marrows at the Allotments (Key 5; levels/primrose/keys/stash.gd). The toys are under them: lift them, and
# get out unseen. The marrows win first prize at the show anyway.

~ marrows
[if primrose/in_suit] => suit
[if primrose/stash_lifted] => lifted
[narrator] Under the prize marrows, under the tarpaulin: boxes. DECENCY LEAGUE: LITERATURE.
[narrator] Nim takes the lot. Now out of the Allotments, without a soul seeing her.
set primrose/stash_lifted

~ suit
Nim: On my knees in a vegetable bed, in the suit? Grizelda would hear about it from the Watch by morning.

~ lifted
[narrator] She's got them. Out, quietly.

~ after
[narrator] The marrows sit on an empty bed, looking pleased with themselves.
